From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 19:40:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] po: the notice of a 3D video shown flat on X11 in the
 languages of Sparky Stereo OS

The title and the text of the dialog that 3d-0047 shows when the desktop
does not take the stereo declaration of the video window, in Polish,
Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean and Simplified and
Traditional Chinese.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
---
--- a/po/de.po
+++ b/po/de.po
@@ -30151,3 +30151,17 @@ msgstr ""
 #: modules/gui/qt/menus.cpp
 msgid "Swap left and right eyes"
 msgstr "Linkes und rechtes Auge vertauschen"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid "3D video shown flat"
+msgstr "3D-Video flach angezeigt"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid ""
+"The desktop does not take stereo video windows on X11 (Stereo KWin "
+"does), so only one view of this 3D video is shown. VLC's messages say "
+"why."
+msgstr ""
+"Der Desktop nimmt unter X11 keine stereoskopischen Videofenster an "
+"(Stereo KWin tut es), daher wird nur eine Ansicht dieses 3D-Videos "
+"gezeigt. Die Meldungen von VLC nennen den Grund."
--- a/po/fr.po
+++ b/po/fr.po
@@ -30079,3 +30079,17 @@ msgstr ""
 #: modules/gui/qt/menus.cpp
 msgid "Swap left and right eyes"
 msgstr "Permuter les vues gauche et droite"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid "3D video shown flat"
+msgstr "Vidéo 3D affichée à plat"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid ""
+"The desktop does not take stereo video windows on X11 (Stereo KWin "
+"does), so only one view of this 3D video is shown. VLC's messages say "
+"why."
+msgstr ""
+"Le bureau n'accepte pas les fenêtres vidéo stéréo sous X11 (Stereo "
+"KWin les accepte) : une seule vue de cette vidéo 3D est donc affichée. "
+"Les messages de VLC en donnent la raison."
